    titleBold: 'How Backchanneling',
    titleRest: ' Improves the Feel of AI Voice Agents',
    description: 'Backchanneling, the small "mm-hmm" and "right" cues listeners give without taking the floor, shapes how natural an AI voice agent feels on a phone call.',
